# 1. Project setup

This project builds a dataset for predicting UEFA Champions League match outcomes.

The domestic-league dataset covers the five major European leagues from the 2010/11 season through the 2025/26 season.

The leagues are:

- Premier League
- La Liga
- Bundesliga
- Serie A
- Ligue 1

We will eventually combine this information with Champions League data.

